Each time one of your lightning spells dazes a target, it has a [35%, 40%, 45%, 50%, 55% (TL1-5)] chance to creates a chain reaction that summons a mighty Hurricane that lasts for 10 turns around the target with a radius of [2, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)].

Each turn, the afflicted creature and all creatures around it will take [30, 40, 48, 55, 61 (TL1-5; SP 100)] to [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; SP 100)] lightning damage ([60, 80, 97, 110, 122 (TL1-5; SP 100)] average).

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
